# text = The tones of her voice called back her father and his friend , and the aggressor proved to be the eldest son of the latter , the senior by eighteen years of his little brothers Mary sprang forward to take her father's charge , with a girl's fondness for infants , and with some little foresight of the event soon to happen at home ; while young Wilson seemed to lose his rough , cubbish nature as he crowed and cooed to his little brother said the half - proud , half-weary father , as he bestowed a smacking kiss on the babe ere he parted with it quoth hearty-voiced Wilson , as the two women rose and shook themselves in preparation for their homeward walk .
