# text = And when he knows trade is bad , and could understand ( at least partially ) that there are not buyers enough in the market to purchase the goods already made , and consequently that there is no demand for more ; when he would bear and endure much without complaining , could he also see that his employers were bearing their share ; he is , I say , bewildered and ( to use his own word ) " aggravated " to see that all goes on just as usual with the millowners .
