# text = " Well , Mary , dear " ( knowing well how little " dear " Mary considered her just then replied Mary , in no welcoming tone said the unabashed Sally looking round as well as she could ; for Mary made no haste to perform the hospitable offices of striking a match , and lighting a candle said Mary shortly , and busying herself at last about the candle , without ever asking her visitor to sit down answered Sally said Mary , speaking at last heartily ; and running to the door , she would have fastened it , but Sally held her hands , laughing meanwhile at her distress struggling as footsteps approached ; and then , as they passed the house , and seemed to give her a respite , she continued said Sally , in a more relenting mood said Mary , feeling that the interview must be , and had better be anywhere than at home , where her father might return at any minute .
