# text = She did not speak so decidedly as before ; there was a hesitation in her manner , that seemed to make her very attractive ; as if something softer , more lovable than excellent sense , were coming in as a motive for speech ; her eyes had always been soft , and were in no ways disfigured by her blindness , and now seemed to have a new charm , as they quivered under their white , downcast lids .
