# text = In pursuance of her plan , Esther meant to assume the manners and character , as she had done the dress , of a mechanic's wife ; but then , to account for her long absence , and her long silence towards all that ought to have been dear to her , it was necessary that she should put on an indifference far distant from her heart , which was loving and yearning , in spite of all its faults .
