# text = And , perhaps , she over-acted her part , for certainly Mary felt a kind of repugnance to the changed and altered aunt , who so suddenly reappeared on the scene ; and it would have cut Esther to the very core , could she have known how her little darling of former days was feeling towards her she began asked Mary faintly , still looking at the face which was so different from the old recollections of her aunt's fresh dazzling beauty sighing forth the thoughts it suggested ; then , recovering herself , and striving after the hard character she wished to assume , she continued Mary's tears flowed afresh , but she had no desire to open her heart to her strangely-found aunt , who had , by her own confession , kept aloof from and neglected them for so many years .
