# text = So she spoke in a low gentle tone the loving sentences , which sound so broken and powerless in repetition , and which yet have so much power when accompanied with caressing looks and actions , fresh from the heart ; and the old woman insensibly gave herself up to the influence of those sweet , loving blue eyes , those tears of sympathy , those words of love and hope , and was lulled into a less morbid state of mind Ay ! he went out near upon five ; he went out with Will ; he said he were going to set him a part of the way , for Will were hot upon walking to Liverpool , and wouldn't hearken to Jem's offer of lending him five shillings for his fare .
