# text = She was thankful , therefore , when Job Legh's voice was heard at the door , as he stood with the latch in his hand , talking to a neighbour , and when Sally jumped up in vexation and said So far in a whisper , then louder She and Job passed each other at the door , with mutual looks of dislike , which neither took any pains to conceal said Job to Mary replied Mary , too honourable to abuse a visitor , who had only that instant crossed her threshold , and gladly dwelling on the good quality most apparent in Sally's character said Mary , who began to dread her part in doing anything which might tell against her poor lover replied Job , whose contempt for medical men pretty nearly equalled his respect for lawyers
