# text = In that new world of sight and sound , she still bore one prevailing thought , and though her eye glanced over the ships and the wide-spreading river , her mind was full of the thought of reaching Will asked she of Charley replied he , rather contemptuously Mary assented quietly to this speech , as if she were as careless as Charley seemed now to be about her overtaking Will ; but in truth her heart was sinking within her , and she no longer felt the energy which had hitherto upheld her .
