# text = He was shown in to Mr . Bridgnorth , who was writing ; Mary and Will Wilson had not yet arrived , being , as you know , far away on the broad sea ; but of this Job of course knew nothing , and he did not as yet feel much anxiety about their non-appearance ; he was more curious to know the result of Mr . Bridgnorth's interview that morning with Jem said Mr . Bridgnorth , putting down his pen asked Job breathlessly said Job despondingly replied Mr . Bridgnorth , quickly and decisively with an emphasis on the word He began to write again , for he had no time to lose said Job with vehemence .
