# text = For sure , I , who am his mother , and have nursed him on my knee , and been gladdened by the sight of him every day since , ought to know him better than yon pack of fellows " ( indicating the jury , while she strove against her heart to render her words distinct and clear for her dear son's sake While sobbing out these words she was led away by the officers of the court , but tenderly , and reverently , with the respect which great sorrow commands .
