# text = Old Mr . Carson felt an additional beat at his heart at the thought of seeing the fatal Helen , the cause of all ,-- a kind of interest and yet repugnance , for was not she beloved by the dead ; nay , perhaps , in her way , loving and mourning for the same being that he himself was so bitterly grieving over ?
