# text = He tried to hear the low quick mutterings of her voice , as he caught the repetition of the same words over and over again Suddenly she seemed to become aware how earnestly Job was listening ( with mournful attention ) to her words , and turning sharp round upon him , with upbraiding for his eavesdropping on her lips , she caught sight of something ,-- or some one ,-- who even in that state , had power to arrest her attention ; and throwing up her arms with wild energy , she shrieked aloud --
