# text = Before it was fairly light , Jem ( wide awake , and listening with an earnest attention he could not deaden , however painful its results proved ) heard a gentle subdued knock at the house door ; it was no business of his , to be sure , to open it , but as Ben slept on , he thought he would see who the early visitor might be , and ascertain if there was any occasion for disturbing either host or hostess .
