# text = For in such case , worn out by anxiety , and it may be by much watching , our very excess of grief rocks itself to sleep , before we have had time to realise its cause ; and we waken , with a start of agony like a fresh stab , to the consciousness of the one awful vacancy , which shall never , while the world endures , be filled again .
