# text = But suddenly , while he was deliberating , and searching for motives which should be effective to compel him to exertion and action once more ; while he contemplated the desire after riches , social distinction , a name among the merchant-princes amidst whom he moved , and saw these false substances fade away into the shadows they truly are , and one by one disappear into the grave of his son ,-- suddenly , I say , the thought arose within him that more yet remained to be learned about the circumstances and feelings which had prompted John Barton's crime ; and when once this mournful curiosity was excited , it seemed to gather strength in every moment that its gratification was delayed .
