# text = He and his companion , a kind-hearted policeman , were admitted , suspiciously enough , by the landlady , who ushered them into a large garret where twenty or thirty people of all ages and both sexes lay and dosed away the day , choosing the evening and night for their trades of beggary , thieving , or prostitution said she , looking round asked Jem They made some inquiries , and found that in the restlessness of approaching death , she had longed to be once more in the open air , and had gone forth -- where , no one seemed to be able to tell .
